rge-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Structure Essentials</a></span></li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n<h2><strong>🔹內容擴充模組</strong></h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h2><strong>🔹生活品質與實用工具</strong></h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ol style=\"padding-left:1em\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-advancements\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Advancements</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/item-highlighter-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Item Highlighter</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jade\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jade</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/model-gap-fix\" rel=\"nofollow\">Model Gap Fix</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mouse-tweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mouse Tweaks</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/overflowing-bars\" rel=\"nofollow\">Overflowing Bars</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pick-up-notifier\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pick Up Notifier</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skin-layers-3d\" rel=\"nofollow\">Skin Layers</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/attributefix\" rel=\"nofollow\">AttributeFix</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bisecthosting-server-integration-menu-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">BH Server Integration</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chat-heads\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chat Heads</a></span></li>\n<li><spa