e-cam\" rel=\"nofollow\">Freecam</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModMenu</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/searchables\" rel=\"nofollow\">Searchables</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-discord-rich-presence\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple Discord Rich Presence</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zoomify\" rel=\"nofollow\">Zoomify</a></span></li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n<h2><strong>🔹資源包</strong></h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ol style=\"padding-left:1em\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/hellims-xaeros-maps-mob-icons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hellim's Xaero's Maps Mob Icons</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/hellims-connected-textures\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hellim's Connected Textures</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/hellims-3d-blocks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hellim's 3D Blocks</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/hellims-glowing-textures\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hellim's Glowing Textures</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/hellims-better-gui-hud-dark\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hellim's Better GUI+HUD (Dark)</a></span></li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Lx7FiD4.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial\">🔹使用 BisectHosting 託管您的 MODPACK 遊戲伺服器，與摯愛之人享受刺激的遊玩體驗。擁有超過十年的經驗與遍布全球 20 個地點的伺服器節點，BisectHosting 是實現流暢暢快遊戲的完美選擇。透過其自動化的整合包安裝與更新系統，隨時掌握伺服器最新動態；遇到任何遊戲相關問題，皆可依賴其全天候客服團隊提供協助。新客戶請務必輸入優惠碼 HELLIM，首月可享 25% 折扣！🔹</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fHELLIM\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iXh8VDe.png\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial\">🔹感謝 Bisect Hosting 以伺服器資源與技術支援我們的專案。🔹</span></strong></span></p>",
